MODEL LICENSE
=============

The pre-trained model weights in this repository (segmentation/pytorch_model.bin
and embedding/pytorch_model.bin, "the Models") are licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC 4.0).

Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode

Summary of terms:
- Attribution (BY): you must give appropriate credit (Re:WayAI, https://huggingface.co/rewayai/suplime),
  provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made.
- NonCommercial (NC): you may not use the Models for commercial purposes.

You are free to:
- use the Models for academic research and other non-commercial purposes;
- share and redistribute the Models with proper attribution and this notice;
- modify or adapt the Models for non-commercial use.

You must not:
- use the Models or derivatives thereof for commercial purposes, including
  products, services or paid offerings;
- remove or alter this license notice in copies of the Models.

Reason for this restriction:
The segmentation model is trained on a mixture of corpora, several of which are
licensed for research / non-commercial use only (e.g. RAMC, MSDWild, AVA-AVD)
or under share-alike terms (AISHELL-4, AliMeeting, CC BY-SA 4.0). To respect the
most restrictive source terms, the weights are released for research purposes
only. The embedding model is a conversion of WeSpeaker's voxblink2_samresnet34_ft
(trained on VoxBlink2 and VoxCeleb2) and is redistributed under the same terms.

Note:
The source code of the accompanying `suplime` Python package is licensed
separately (MIT; the SimAM-ResNet backbone under Apache-2.0). This file applies
only to the model weights.
